    "type": "message",
    "user": "U08RZQ547LJ",
    "text": "Hey \u003c@U0BTUQGHDDF\u003e, the issue is that too many snapshot entries are being stored in your Iceberg table’s _metdata.json_.\n\n*Solution:* Expire old snapshots after a certain limit to keep _metadata.json_ under 1 MB. Before that, I’d like to confirm: are you still in the POC stage, or is this a production issue right now?",
