  {
    "client_msg_id": "1f9a1382-56a9-4531-be6a-946ed01e079b",
    "type": "message",
    "user": "U08RZQ547LJ",
    "text": "Hey \u003c@U0BTUQGHDDF\u003e, to unblock right away, run `expire_snapshots` with Spark on each of your OLake ingested Iceberg tables in BigLake. For example:\n```CALL lenskart_operational_db.system.expire_snapshots(\n  table =\u003e 'juno_v2_prod_order_juno_v2_prod_order.order_v2',\n  older_than =\u003e TIMESTAMP '2026-10-04 00:00:00',\n  retain_last =\u003e 100\n);```\nThis removes snapshots older than Oct 4 and always keeps the latest 100, which brings metadata.json well under 1 MB.\n\nYou can run that in the Spark serverless option available in Google BigQuery. Snapshots will keep piling up with every sync, so you need to schedule it.",
    "ts": "1791312438.761109",
    "thread_ts": "1791283377.097869",
    "edited": {
      "user": "U08RZQ547LJ",
      "ts": "1791313114.000000"
    },
    "parent_user_id": "U0BTUQGHDDF",
    "team": "T0820LGJGRF",
    "replace_original": false,
    "delete_original": false,
    "metadata": {
      "event_type": "",
      "event_payload": null
    },
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "rich_text",
        "block_id": "rY3xR",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hey "
              },
              {
                "type": "user",
                "user_id": "U0BTUQGHDDF"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", to unblock right away, run "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "expire_snapshots",
                "style": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " with Spark on each of your OLake ingested Iceberg tables in BigLake. For example:\n"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "rich_text_preformatted",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "CALL lenskart_operational_db.system.expire_snapshots(\n  table =\u003e 'juno_v2_prod_order_juno_v2_prod_order.order_v2',\n  older_than =\u003e TIMESTAMP '2026-10-04 00:00:00',\n  retain_last =\u003e 100\n);"
              }
            ],
            "border": 0
          },
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\nThis removes snapshots older than Oct 4 and always keeps the latest 100, which brings metadata.json well under 1 MB.\n\nYou can run that in the Spark serverless option available in Google BigQuery. Snapshots will keep piling up with every sync, so you need to schedule it."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "user_team": "T0820LGJGRF",
    "source_team": "T0820LGJGRF",
    "user_profile": {
