            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\nRegarding this, we have never seen such an issue with other catalogs, as none of them had the 1 MB "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "metadata.json",
                "style": {
                  "italic": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " limit. BigLake's catalog is also evolving and is still relatively immature.\n\nWe’ll brainstorm this internally over the next week and explore what kind of solution we can implement in OLake-Go so that users don’t have to face this issue, at least when using BigLake.\n\n\nFor now, you’ll have to run / schedule the snapshot expiry script manually."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
